Examples::

Activating model selection for ACV and GenACV:

.. tab:: Freeform

   .. code-block:: dakota

       method,
           model_pointer = 'ENSEMBLE'
           approximate_control_variate acv_mf
             pilot_samples = 50 seed = 8674132
             search_model_graphs
               no_recursion              # ACV case
               model_selection           # this option
             max_function_evaluations = 500

.. tab:: JSON

   .. code-block:: json

       {
         "method": [
           {
             "approximate_control_variate": {
               "model_pointer": "ENSEMBLE",
               "pilot_samples": [50],
               "seed_sequence": [8674132],
               "search_model_graphs": {
                 "no_recursion": {},
                 "model_selection": {}
               },
               "max_function_evaluations": 500
             }
           }
         ]
       }

Activating model selection for weighted MLMC:

.. tab:: Freeform

   .. code-block:: dakota

       method,
           model_pointer = 'ENSEMBLE'
           multilevel_sampling weighted
             pilot_samples = 50 seed = 8674132
             search_model_graphs
               no_recursion              # fixed ordering in hierarchical DAG
               model_selection           # this option
           max_function_evaluations = 500

.. tab:: JSON

   .. code-block:: json

       {
         "method": [
           {
             "multilevel_sampling": {
               "model_pointer": "ENSEMBLE",
               "weighted": {},
               "pilot_samples": [50],
               "seed_sequence": [8674132],
               "search_model_graphs": {
                 "no_recursion": {},
                 "model_selection": {}
               },
               "max_function_evaluations": 500
             }
           }
         ]
       }

